 "The custom fan curve normally only rests at 0 (off) or 40 % and above, and the graph is drawn with a break across that gap. The reason: on both the Claw 8 AI+ and the Claw 8 EX the fan sits on its minimum-spin plateau below ~40, so 20 and 40 measured the same RPM — a slider that promises a difference it cannot deliver.": "自定义风扇曲线通常只停在 0（关）或 40% 及以上，图表在二者之间以断点绘制。原因：在 Claw 8 AI+ 与 Claw 8 EX 上，风扇在约 40 以下处于最低转速平台，20 与 40 测得的转速相同——滑块承诺的差异实际无法实现。",
